<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>We'd love to help you find your perfect property</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f7fa; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <tr>
            <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a365d 0%, #2d5a87 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
                <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">{{ company_name }}</h1>
                <p style="color: #a3c4e8; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px;">Your Property Partner</p>
            </td>
        </tr>

        <!-- Body -->
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 30px;">
                <h2 style="color: #1a365d; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 20px;">Hi {{ first_name }},</h2>

                <p style="color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px;">
                    Thank you for your interest in {{ interest }} properties{% if location %} in <strong>{{ location }}</strong>{% endif %}. We wanted to follow up and let you know we have some exciting options that may be a great fit for you.
                </p>

                {% if budget %}
                <p style="color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px;">
                    Based on your budget of <strong>{{ currency }} {{ "{:,}".format(budget|int) }}</strong>, we've identified several properties that match your criteria.
                </p>
                {% endif %}

                <p style="color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 15px;">
                    We'd love to schedule a quick call to walk you through the best options available. Our team is ready to help you find exactly what you're looking for.
                </p>

                <!-- CTA Button -->
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" align="center">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d5a87 0%, #1a365d 100%); border-radius: 8px;">
                            <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}?subject=Property%20Enquiry%20Follow-up" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">
                                Schedule a Call &rarr;
                            </a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>

        <!-- Divider -->
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 30px;">
                <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 0;">
            </td>
        </tr>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 24px 30px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="color: #a0aec0; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    {{ company_name }} &mdash; Helping you close, swiftly.
                </p>
                <p style="color: #cbd5e0; font-size: 11px; margin: 0;">
                    You're receiving this because you enquired about a property with us.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
